@startuml
title F2 - Sales Order Submission and Real-time Validation
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #333333
skinparam RoundCorner 15
skinparam wrapWidth 220

|Retailer / Sales|
start
:Sign in with Google
(Sales selects an assigned Retailer, Retailer orders by itself);

|System|
:Verify Google token, account Active and access scope;
if (Account and scope valid?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Reject (401/403);
  stop
endif

|Retailer / Sales|
:Open catalog (Published SKUs, current price, reference availability - MLOR hidden);
:Add SKUs with whole quantities to the cart;
:Choose one eligible quantity promotion (optional);

|System|
:Recompute promotion on server
(SKU-group promotion sums member quantities);

|Retailer / Sales|
:Enter delivery address and expected delivery date;
:Review order - payment method is NOT chosen yet
(only a reference credit eligibility is shown);
:Submit SO with client order key (idempotency key);

|System|
if (Same key and same payload already accepted?) then (yes)
  :Return the existing SO;
  stop
else (no)
endif
:Validate account, assignment, SKU, effective price and promotion;
:Check Region and service radius per SKU against candidate warehouses;
if (All validations passed?) then (yes)
  :Snapshot price and promotion into SO lines;
  :Compute reference credit eligibility (does NOT block the SO);
  :Assign AcceptedAt (server time), status = Allocating;
  :Enqueue allocation for this SO only (ordered by AcceptedAt, tie-break by SO code);
  :Notify client - SO is Allocating;
else (no)
  :Return field-level error (no SO, no reservation);
  note right: User corrects the input and resubmits
  stop
endif

if (Withdrawn before reservation is committed?) then (yes)
  :Cancel queued attempt, SO = Withdrawn, no stock held;
  stop
else (no)
endif

:Hand over SalesOrderId + AcceptedAt + input snapshot to F3;
stop
@enduml
